  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Wu Zhan Ping presents this to Wu Ji of Wu clan after she refuses Corpse Emperor true inheritance. He says it has a greater origin; it concerns Spectral Soul Demon Venerable. Once a seven-seven profound soul bird is created, it is almost impossible to kill, and if they are gravely injured, as long as one still lives they reappear in a short time. The true inheritance lacks Immortal Gu, but can bypass that lack by nurturing soul beasts, which Wu Zhan Ping says makes the cultivation journey easier. Wu Ji refuses it, saying she dislikes raising soul beasts. Wu Zhen Zhu still ranks it with Corpse Emperor true inheritance as extremely rare.",
